# ProofShape container gate: findings with NO published fix in Debian trixie as of 2026-09-15.
# Gate runs severity HIGH,CRITICAL with ignore-unfixed=false; without these pins main stays red
# on issues no Dockerfile change can fix. Revisit on each base-image refresh; remove as Debian
# publishes fixes.
# util-linux source (status: affected, no fix published): mount/namespace hardening issues;
# app runs as non-root cadverify user and performs no mount operations.
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410
# libacl1 (status: affected): symlink traversal via libacl; no published fix.
CVE-2026-54369
# systemd libs (status: affected): libsystemd0/libudev1 pulled in by mesa/X runtime deps.
CVE-2026-16742
# ncurses libtinfo6/ncurses-bin (no published fix in trixie).
CVE-2025-69720
# perl-base (status: fix_deferred by the Debian security team).
CVE-2026-9538

# Round 2 (reviewed 2026-09-15; post-merge main gate run 35043081368, Trivy DB
# cache-trivy-2026-09-16). libsqlite3-0 was fixed via Dockerfile upgrade to
# 3.46.1-7+deb13u2 and is NOT ignored. The 8 below have no fixed version published
# in Debian trixie as of this date. Common mitigations: every /api/v1 route is
# API-key gated (no anonymous reachability); the container runs as non-root user
# cadverify with no host mounts.
# libxml2 2.12.7+dfsg+really2.9.14-2.1+deb13u3 (status: affected, no fix published):
#   CRITICAL DoS via crafted XML (CVE-2026-6653), HIGH double-free/UAF in Python
#   bindings (CVE-2026-74860), stack overflow in xmlSnprintfElements
#   (CVE-2026-86140). Input path: xmlsec1 signature verification on authenticated
#   requests only.
CVE-2026-6653
CVE-2026-74860
CVE-2026-86140
# libexpat1 2.8.3-1~deb13u1 (status: affected, no fix published): DoS via quadratic
#   attribute processing (CVE-2026-66046), hash-flooding DoS (CVE-2026-76956),
#   memory corruption/ACE (CVE-2026-76957). Reachable only through fontconfig/xmlsec
#   on authenticated requests.
CVE-2026-66046
CVE-2026-76956
CVE-2026-76957
# libtiff6 4.7.0-3+deb13u3: CVE-2026-36849 status will_not_fix by Debian (DoS via
#   large SamplesPerPixel); CVE-2026-52490 status affected, no fix published (ACE
#   via process_command_opts). Reachable via TIFF decode of API-key-gated image
#   uploads; processing is confined to the non-root container.
CVE-2026-36849
CVE-2026-52490

# Round 3 (reviewed 2026-09-15; gate run 35048087571, Trivy DB roll ~02:40Z).
# libxml2 2.12.7+dfsg+really2.9.14-2.1+deb13u3 (status: affected, no fixed version
