#   non-root container.
CVE-2026-86138
CVE-2026-86139
CVE-2026-86142
CVE-2026-86143
CVE-2026-86144
# login 1:4.16.0-2+really2.41.5-0+deb13u1 (CVE-2026-53612/53613/53614, util-linux
#   TOCTOU/SUID mount issues): FALSE POSITIVE - the installed login binary IS the
#   util-linux 2.41.5-0+deb13u1 build Trivy names as the fix; Trivy mis-compares
#   the epoch/renamed binary version against the source fix version. Also not
#   reachable: the app runs as non-root cadverify and performs no mount ops.
CVE-2026-53612
CVE-2026-53613
